{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-session-ctxmenu#card-zh","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-session-ctxmenu","commit":"e1ac6ff47d56ce01e61014a2dec397b96c6c0679","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-ctxmenu 是一款面向 DSH Web 的侧边栏右键菜单插件。它在浏览器文档上注册捕获阶段的 contextmenu 监听器，定位被右键点击的 treeitem 行，并点击该行已有的省略号按钮来打开 DSH 自带菜单。用户可从会话行打开重命名、分叉或归档菜单，也可从项目行打开重命名或删除菜单；没有菜单按钮的行和行外点击保留浏览器原生行为。适合希望直接右键操作侧边栏会话或项目的 Web 用户。插件无需 API 密钥或外部服务，需安装到 web profile 并重启 DSH Web。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:44-63","package.json:25-32"]}
{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-session-ctxmenu#card-en","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-session-ctxmenu","commit":"e1ac6ff47d56ce01e61014a2dec397b96c6c0679","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-ctxmenu adds right-click menus to DSH Web sidebar rows. It clicks the selected row’s ellipsis button to open built-in actions: rename, fork, or archive for sessions; rename or delete for projects. Rows without menus keep native behavior. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:44-63","package.json:25-32"]}
