{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-session-ctxmenu#feature-session-menu","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-session-ctxmenu","commit":"e1ac6ff47d56ce01e61014a2dec397b96c6c0679","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-ctxmenu 的功能「会话行右键菜单」：在 DSH Web 侧边栏会话行上右键时，插件点击该行现有的省略号按钮，打开原有菜单以使用重命名、分叉或归档操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:44-51"]}
{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-session-ctxmenu#feature-project-menu","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-session-ctxmenu","commit":"e1ac6ff47d56ce01e61014a2dec397b96c6c0679","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-ctxmenu 的功能「项目行右键菜单」：在带有菜单按钮的项目 treeitem 行上右键，插件打开该行的 DSH 内置菜单，供用户选择重命名或删除。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:28-32","lib/client.js:44-51"]}
{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-session-ctxmenu#feature-native-fallback","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-session-ctxmenu","commit":"e1ac6ff47d56ce01e61014a2dec397b96c6c0679","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-ctxmenu 的功能「保留原生右键行为」：点击不在 treeitem 行内，或该行没有省略号菜单按钮时，插件不阻止 contextmenu 事件，浏览器继续显示原生菜单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:44-50"]}
